                     \x20         - powershell: `PowerShell`\n\
                     \x20         - zsh:        Z `SHell` (zsh)\n\
                     \x20         - nushell:    Nushell\n\
                     \n\
                     Options:\n\
                     \x20 -h, --help\n\
                     \x20         Print help (see a summary with '-h')\n"
                )
            } else {
                format!(
                    "Generate shell completions\n\
                     \n\
                     Usage: {bin} completions <SHELL>\n\
                     \n\
                     Arguments:\n\
                     \x20 <SHELL>  The shell to generate completions for [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh, nushell]\n\
                     \n\
